  "title": "Inside Aircraft Egress Systems",
  "description": "Hope is not the emergency procedure. \r\nBehind every safe flight is a team prepared for the unthinkable, maintaining the critical escape and survival systems pilots rely on in emergencies. From ejection seats to canopy systems, egress Airmen ensure every piece of equipment is mission ready before wheels leave the ground.\r\nAt the 56th Fighter Wing, these behind-the-scenes professionals play a vital role in generating combat capability and keeping pilots ready to fly, fight, and win, anytime, anywhere.",
